  "content": "\n\n<p>將藥水加入你的食物中</p>\n<p><em>&ldquo;PPAP&rdquo;&mdash;&mdash;</em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fauthor%252f22992.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>道家深湖</em></a>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/taoismdeeplake\" rel=\"nofollow\">深湖道家</a>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組新增一個方塊——「藥水桌」。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/320/c2-97j_1shab7fak-w56uk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"349\" height=\"264\"><br>將原版藥水放入輸入槽，並將原版藥水或食物放入輸出槽。點擊按鈕消耗藥水，將藥水效果附加至槽內物品。可進行多次疊加，食用後觸發效果。</p>",
